{"number": 19, "name": "S5.1 -- The kit history over the per-user preferences", "brief": "Read specs/0050/.spec-md first. Its sections 0-10 bind every section: the wiring contract, precedence, the interpretations of sec 3, the constraints of sec 4, the shared shapes of sec 5, reuse, migration intent, negative scope, verification and gates, and the UX commitments. 001 (specs/0050/.manual/001-library-files-database-multi-setup-inverse.md) is the requirement; read the parts this brief names. Choose each step's gates by .user-md/spec-author.user-md 'Choosing a step's gates'. kit-acceptance is not runnable before S12.1 creates KitAcceptanceTests.fs.\n\nAuthor 001 sec F ('History', 'Storage') and sec R ('The 16-entry recent.json list'). Soft budget: 8-14 steps.\n\nDomain (pure):\n- A history entry: { folder : KitFolder; kitId; name cache; last opened (from ClockProvider); star : StarredKit | UnstarredKit }.\n- bump: MOVED from RecentFiles.bump and generalised from file names to entries (case-insensitive folder identity, newest first).\n- star, unstar, forget.\n- evict: over the cap, drop the OLDEST UNSTARRED entry, never a starred one.\n- The display order: starred first by last open, then the rest by last open.\n\nSettings: KitHistoryLimit = 100, a ConfigKey in AppConfig.fs with a settings door, carried in WorkbenchSettings.\n\nKitHistoryProxy:\n- a record and an in-memory implementation in Domain;\n- a Storage create over the DataLocations preferences folder: file kit-history.json, atomic write. A missing or unreadable file gives an empty history and a logged warning;\n- a 'folder exists' probe feeds the missing state.\n\nDelete RecentFiles.maxRecent, prefsPath, loadRecent, FileName.pushRecent and recent.json, and RecentFiles.fs itself if nothing remains.\n\nTests: MRU order; starred entries stay on top; the cap evicts the oldest unstarred entry; a full starred list never evicts a star; forget; the persistence round trip under the test output.\n\nGates: build, elevation, constructor-unit-tests.", "pointers": ["specs/0050/.spec-md", "specs/0050/.manual/001-library-files-database-multi-setup-inverse.md", "AGENTS.md", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Storage/RecentFiles.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Domain/WorkbenchSettings.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.App/AppConfig.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Domain/Kit.fs"], "invariants": ["ASSERT_INVARIANT s19-elev-list-empty must-find-nothing: git grep -n -F \"ELEV0\" -- Elevation/elevation-known-findings.json", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s19-no-vstest must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk|xunit.runner.visualstudio|Xunit.SkippableFact|IsTestingPlatformApplication\" -- \"*.fsproj\" \"*.props\" \"*.targets\"", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s19-no-kit-kit-json must-find-nothing: git grep -n -F \"kit.kit-json\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s19-no-eps-axis-evaluated must-find-nothing: git grep -n -F \"EpsAxisEvaluated\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s19-complexity-mandatory must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"complexity = (None|Some)\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s19-no-seeded-string-preset-ids must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"(src-(600|hene-|ar-4|ar-5|hecd-|diode-|ruby-|tisa-|ndyag-|er-1550|co2-|hg-|krf-|arf-|f2-1|euv-|beuv-|xe-mono|supercontinuum)|det-(intensity|ellipsometer)|pol-(lp|cp-left|cp-right))\" -- \"Berreman/*.fs\"", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s19-no-seeding-seam must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"SeedingProxy|seedAll|OpticalConstructor.Seeding\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s19-t1-no-code-seeds must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"let (builtInEntries|seedEntries|standardCategories) \" -- Berreman/OpticalConstructor/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s19-no-seed-modules must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"SeedSamples|SeedSources|SeedEntryIds\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s19-no-test-db must-find-nothing: git grep -n -w -E \"TestDbContext|DatabaseProvider|databaseProvider|OpticalConstructorMssql\" -- Ber