hing: git grep -n -w -E \"TestDbContext|DatabaseProvider|databaseProvider|OpticalConstructorMssql\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s23-no-versions-in-use must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"VersionsInUse|versionsInUseSeam\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s23-no-scene-collection-seams must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"SceneProxy|ExperimentCollectionProxy\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s23-t4-no-ocproj must-find-nothing: git grep -n -i -F \"ocproj\" -- Berreman/OpticalConstructor/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s23-no-recent-json must-find-nothing: git grep -n -F \"recent.json\" -- Berreman/"]}
{"number": 24, "name": "S7.2 -- The Items panel, the flow strip and item mapping on copy", "brief": "Read specs/0050/.spec-md first. Its sections 0-10 bind every section: the wiring contract, precedence, the interpretations of sec 3, the constraints of sec 4, the shared shapes of sec 5, reuse, migration intent, negative scope, verification and gates, and the UX commitments. 001 (specs/0050/.manual/001-library-files-database-multi-setup-inverse.md) is the requirement; read the parts this brief names. Choose each step's gates by .user-md/spec-author.user-md 'Choosing a step's gates'. kit-acceptance is not runnable before S12.1 creates KitAcceptanceTests.fs.\n\nAuthor 001 sec O ('a left flow strip...', 'Items panel'), sec P (AddItem, SetParameterState) and sec H's item mapping, with .spec-md secs 3.15 and 3.22. Soft budget: 10-18 steps.\n\nThe flow strip (its own view file), on the left of the constructor window:\n- In this section its steps are Items, Setups (the table) and Experiments (the existing Experiments bay).\n- Later sections insert Data (S9.3), then Unknowns, Fit, Results and Publish (S11), then Plan (S14), each at its 001 sec O position.\n- Every step is reachable directly, with ids.\n\nThe Items panel (its own view file):\n- the kit's item list;\n- 'Add item from library model...', a picker over presets, samples and item models;\n- a parameter grid (state, value, bounds, sigma, provenance), the dial mapping (zero, sign) and the revision list.\n- Messages AddItem and SetParameterState, plus label, notes and photo edits. Ids KitItemList, AddItemButton, ItemParameterGrid, and so on. Writes go through KitProxy.\n\nCopy experiments (S6): after the experiments are picked, a mapping table lists every item they use, each with 'map to existing item' or 'add'. The default maps by identical model + label, and otherwise adds.\n\nHeadless tests run over in-memory kits; ui-smoke renders the panel; any new window joins ScrollExtentTests.\n\nGates: build, elevation, const