{"number": 32, "name": "S9.4 -- The optics-mueller lab files move into the kit folder", "brief": "Read specs/0050/.spec-md first. Its sections 0-10 bind every section: the wiring contract, precedence, the interpretations of sec 3, the constraints of sec 4, the shared shapes of sec 5, reuse, migration intent, negative scope, verification and gates, and the UX commitments. 001 (specs/0050/.manual/001-library-files-database-multi-setup-inverse.md) is the requirement; read the parts this brief names. Choose each step's gates by .user-md/spec-author.user-md 'Choosing a step's gates'. kit-acceptance is not runnable before S12.1 creates KitAcceptanceTests.fs.\n\nAuthor 001 sec Q AT-1 'Data:' (the move), the last bullet of sec S9, and sec R ('MuellerDataSet ... the archive-keyed MuellerDataProxy and Berreman/Data/MuellerMatrix/'), with .spec-md secs 3.20-3.21. Soft budget: 8-14 steps.\n\nThe move:\n- Extract the CSV entries of Berreman/Data/MuellerMatrix/data.zip byte-for-byte to data/optics-mueller/data/raw/..., keeping their archive-relative paths: data/raw/final/lp_lp.csv becomes data/optics-mueller/data/raw/final/lp_lp.csv, and the exploratory CSVs land under data/raw/.\n- The three data/shapes/*.json go to data/optics-mueller/data/reference/shapes/.\n- git mv README.md, cpl_cpl_analyzer.py, matrix_glue.py, matrix_step1_air_fit.py, matrix_fit_linear.py, reference_step1_summary.json and reference_step2_linear_summary.json to data/optics-mueller/data/reference/.\n- Update the README's paths, and its 'tests read data.zip through MuellerDataStore' text, to the kit layout.\n- Delete Berreman/Data/MuellerMatrix/ and the data.zip Content link in BerremanTests.fsproj.\n- No .kit-json yet; S12.1 creates the kit around these files.\n\nDELETE:\n- from MuellerReconstruction.fs: MuellerDataSet, MuellerArchivePath, MuellerDataProxy, and the archive cases of MuellerDataError (ArchiveUnreadableErr, DataSetMissingErr);\n- from MuellerDataStore.fs: committedArchive, createArchiveBacked, 