{"number": 37, "name": "S11.2 -- The forward model of an experiment and the study residual", "brief": "Read specs/0050/.spec-md first. Its sections 0-10 bind every section: the wiring contract, precedence, the interpretations of sec 3, the constraints of sec 4, the shared shapes of sec 5, reuse, migration intent, negative scope, verification and gates, and the UX commitments. 001 (specs/0050/.manual/001-library-files-database-multi-setup-inverse.md) is the requirement; read the parts this brief names. Choose each step's gates by .user-md/spec-author.user-md 'Choosing a step's gates'. kit-acceptance is not runnable before S12.1 creates KitAcceptanceTests.fs.\n\nAuthor 001 sec N ('The forward model of an experiment'), sec K ('Observables ... A study mixes them'), sec L (weights, ablation) and sec R (SolverHandoffView: 'Its three validation checks are reused as the study's pre-fit checks'). Soft budget: 10-18 steps.\n\nForward model (Domain, pure, over S8.1's evaluator): slots + scan point + parameter vector give the predicted reading:\n- intensity detector: S0 x gain + dark;\n- Mueller polarimeter: Mueller elements + throughput (the MuellerObservation shape, REUSING the semantics of MuellerInverse.observationResidual / residualVector);\n- ellipsometer: Psi / Delta.\n\nStudy residual: one weighted residual vector over every enabled experiment of the study, against the attached data (through the profiles), at a parameter vector laid out by the generated axes.\n\nPre-fit validation:\n- MOVE SolverHandoffView.fs's three checks into Domain as the study's pre-fit checks: every non-sample slot specified; a data file attached and readable through its profile; the range consistent (the check of ExperimentDataLoad.loadAndValidate).\n- Add S4.2's 'data changed since attach / since the last fit run' flag.\n- SolverHandoffView calls the moved checks until S11.5 deletes it.\n\nTests: the forward model per detector kind; a mixed study residual; weights and disabling; each pre-fit check. The AT-2 model-identity check is asserted in S12.2.\n\nGates: build, elevation, constructor-unit-tests, ui-tests (SolverHandoffWindowTests).", "pointers": ["specs/0050/.spec-md", "specs/0050/.manual/001-library-files-database-multi-setup-inverse.md", "AGENTS.md", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Domain/ExperimentRun.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Domain/MuellerInverse.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/SolverHandoffView.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Domain/ExperimentDataLoad.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Domain/Experiments.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests/SolverHandoffWindowTests.fs"], "invariants": ["ASSERT_INVARIANT s37-elev-list-empty must-find-nothing: git grep -n -F \"ELEV0\" -- Elevation/elevation-known-findings.json", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s37-no-vstest must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk|xunit.runner.visualstudio|Xunit.SkippableFact|IsTestingPlatformApplication\" -- \"*.fsproj\" \"*.props\" \"*.targets\"", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s37-no-kit-kit-json must-find-nothing: git grep -n -F \"kit.kit-json\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s37-no-eps-axis-evaluated must-find-nothing: git grep -n -F \"EpsAxisEvaluated\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s37-complexity-mandatory must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"complexity = (None|Some)\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s37-no-seeded-string-preset-ids must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"(src-(600|hene-|ar-4|ar-5|hecd-|diode-|ruby-|tisa-|ndyag-|er-1550|co2-|hg-|krf-|arf-|f2-1|euv-|beuv-|xe-mono|supercontinuum)|det-(intensity|ellipsometer)|pol-(lp|cp-left|cp-right))\" -- \"Berreman/*.fs\"", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s37-no-seeding-seam must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"SeedingProxy|seedAll|OpticalConstructor.Seeding\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s37-t1-no-code-seeds must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"let (builtInEntries|seedEntries|standardCategories) \" -- Berreman/Opt