xy|createArchiveBacked\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s45-t10-no-harness-noise must-find-nothing: git grep -n -F \"let noisyObserveAbsoluteWith\" -- Berreman/BerremanTests/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s45-no-solver-handoff must-find-nothing: git grep -n -F \"SolverHandoff\" -- Berreman/"]}
{"number": 46, "name": "S14.2 -- The Planner's numerical layer, the plan, the cache and the Plan view", "brief": "Read specs/0050/.spec-md first. Its sections 0-10 bind every section: the wiring contract, precedence, the interpretations of sec 3, the constraints of sec 4, the shared shapes of sec 5, reuse, migration intent, negative scope, verification and gates, and the UX commitments. 001 (specs/0050/.manual/001-library-files-database-multi-setup-inverse.md) is the requirement; read the parts this brief names. Choose each step's gates by .user-md/spec-author.user-md 'Choosing a step's gates'. kit-acceptance is not runnable before S12.1 creates KitAcceptanceTests.fs.\n\nAuthor 001 sec M ('Layer 2, numerical', 'Output', 'Cache', 'Workflow', and the layer-2 / full-rank acceptance facts), sec O 'Plan view' and sec P RunPlan. Soft budget: 12-22 steps.\n\nLayer 2 (Optimization; local, at a nominal point):\n- the Fisher information from the Jacobians of every candidate experiment, REUSING the study engine's OWN forward model and FitQuality.residualJacobian / MuellerInverse.ResidualJacobian (columnNorms, conditionNumber, correlation);\n- the rank (identifiable combinations);\n- the smallest singular vectors (confounded combinations, e.g. thickness <-> n);\n- Cramer-Rao bounds per target, equal to the promoted predictedRelativeErrors (S10.1);\n- greedy D-optimal (or target-restricted A-optimal) selection of the next experiment;\n- the instrument-matrix condition number for choosing polarizer and compensator states.\n\nOutput: a recoverability report, and a measurement plan emitted as setups + experiments with role PlannedRun into the same kit, so plan, measure, attach and fit are one object model.\n\nCache:\n- The key is a hash of (items + parameter states + targets + nominal point).\n- It is stored under .oc/planner/: derived, safe to delete, never sent, and never written by a read-only open.\n- Candidate Jacobians are cached per (sample, experiment), so adding one item computes only the new candidates.\n\nThe Plan view (its own view; the flow strip's Plan step, between Unknowns and Fit):\n- the report (rank, confounded combinations, CRB per target), the ranked candidates, and 'Add to kit';\n- RunPlan on JobRunner with per-candidate progress;\n- ids (PlanRunButton, ...) and ui-smoke.\n\nAcceptance (the existing facts, with their designs reused):\n- MuellerInverseTests' full measurement set gives full rank, with every parameter observable.\n- For its noisy-ensemble design, the planner's bounds equal predictedRelativeErrors; the same holds for AT-2's design.\n\nGates: build, elevation, constructor-unit-tests, unit-tests by class (the planner fact class), ui-smoke, ui-tests by touched class, and kit-acceptance if the planner is asserted on the AT-2 kit.", "pointers": ["specs/0050/.spec-md", "specs/0050/.manual/001-library-files-database-multi-setup-inverse.md", "AGENTS.md", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Optimization/FitQuality.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Domain/MuellerInverse.fs", "Berreman/BerremanTests/MuellerInverseTests.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/JobRunner.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/TableAndElementRotationView.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Controls/UiIds.fs"], "invariants": ["ASSERT_INVARIANT s46-elev-list-empty must-find-nothing: git grep -n -F \"ELEV0\" -- Elevation/elevation-known-findings.json", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s46-no-vstest must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk|xunit.runner.visualstudio|Xunit.SkippableFact|IsTestingPlatformApplication\" -- \"*.fsproj\" \"*.props\" \"*.targets\"", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s46-no-kit-kit-json must-find-nothing: git grep -n -F \"kit.kit-json\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s46-no-eps-axis-evaluated must-find-nothing: git grep -n -F \"EpsAxisEvaluated\" -- Berreman/", "ASSERT_INVARIANT s46-complexity-mandatory must-find-nothing: git grep -n -E \"complexity 